                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I feel like this game, alongside morrowind, captures perfectly the early 2000s era of gaming, it feels so calming to immerse yourself in this beautiful but janky world. The atmosphere and soundtrack make for a really lively world that, despite its age, still manages to keep up with newer games. \n\nMy only complaint is that Activision owns the rights to this game and therefore earns money from sales, despite closing down the poor studio that made it. Long Live Troika Games, creators of Arcanum, Temple of Elemental Evil and VTM: Bloodlines!!",
